2008.10.26 (DD) v3.08 for RISC OS 6
		Various changes to avoid RISC OS 6 obstacles/breakages. Sigh.

2026.11.01 (JB) v3.09
		PCMem: the dynamic area handler is C, through a cmhg veneer,
		as its flags were written to the wrong place (could put
		VRAM page 0 in !PC's slot).
		Grow the screen area before setting the full-screen mode.
		MiddleToPC config option gives the middle button to the PC.
		Mouse port command 9 reads back the ARM's pointer position.
		PCNAT, a network interface for the PC NATed through RISC OS's
		own TCP/IP, and a Netlinks PCBits extension to load it.
